of: record
voice: not architecture but weather: what passes over a place, and what it leaves on it
about: rains daily on a place's bells while it is visited
form: <<END
over: object 1..128
tide: object 1..128
END
text: want stranded "a field that names no place: the town repairs it, or its maker sets it": "stranded" in new.marks.name and not ("repaired" in new.marks.name) asks delvetalk {request.object} repair
body: weather
